 Merge .pacnew and .pacsave files with pacdiff?                                                     
                                                                                                    
 This runs: sudo pacdiff                                                                            
 pacdiff is interactive: it asks what to do with each file; there is no dry run.                    
                                                                                                    
 1 file                                                                                             
   /etc/pacman.d/mirrorlist.pacnew                                                                  
                                                                                                    
 Press y to run it, esc to cancel.                                                                  
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
